# Idempotency & Outbox Foundation (ENT-6)

ENT-6 is locked as completed foundation governance.

1. Use `IdempotencyService` for replay-safe reservations; never store raw idempotency keys.
2. Use `OutboxService` for future cross-module/external side effects; payloads must be PII/secret safe.
3. Outbox events require schema version and payload classification.
4. External dispatch remains disabled unless a later approved sprint explicitly enables it.
5. Never auto-send WhatsApp from a request path.
6. Never auto-create LabOrder from RME payment.
7. Future queued outbox dispatchers must also pass ENT-5 queue retry/failed-job governance.
8. Before later ENT work, run `php artisan foundation:idempotency-outbox-check --strict`.
9. Preserve `queue_governance`, `idempotency`, `outbox`, `queue_retry_governance`, and `idempotency_outbox_governance` summary sections.
